+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                                              |
|   Recover access                                             |
|                                                              |
|   Use this only when no admin can sign in.                   |
|                                                              |
|   1  Let this network reach the admin page again             |
|      (resets who can connect to the admin page)              |
|                                                              |
|   2  Reset an owner's sign-in with a one-time code           |
|                                                              |
|   0  Back                                                    |
|                                                              |
|   Both are recorded, and every admin sees a notice the       |
|   next time they sign in.                                    |
|                                                              |
|   No code was made: Recover access by code isn't installed   |
|   in this build yet                                          |
|                                                              |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
|  1, 2 or 0  Choose     Enter  Back                           |
+--------------------------------------------------------------+
